 "derivation": "Mechanical application of the s2 rule to the corpus's own identifiers. No class, reason set or observer value is involved. The discriminating pair below is pinned by hand from its UTF-8 bytes and cross-checked by builder assertions ordering:discriminating-pair-*.",
